  "registration": "The canonical, rectified, aerial and rear sources lock one four-storey U-shaped hospital: two patient-room wings frame an open therapeutic courtyard, an integrated triple-height glulam atrium anchors the rear of that court, and a broad timber canopy reaches the public arrival. The rear source locks a separate two-bay ambulance arrival while the roof source fixes meadow roofs, service paths, screened plant and the photovoltaic healing-terrace canopy.",
